; RT50 / PT50 (#744). Expectations never obtained by running Tecnigrafo.
; Handwritten scena.dxf: ellipse center (0,0), axes 10 and 5, handle 101 hex.
; Selection at (10,0), Esc while ERASE selects, then Erase / U / REDO.
; Point (10,0) from solid-space tests/corpus/casi/geom2d/
; ellisse-intera-parametri-0-2pi.json, commit fc8cae3da8a737510d6b61075b03ea3272228576.
!view 0,0 0.1 800x600
OPEN
scena.dxf
!snap off
!report
; PT50 makes the ellipse selectable with a click.
; cambia con #744
!click 10,0
!report
!esc
ERASE
!click 10,0
!esc
!report
!click 10,0
ERASE
!report
U
!report
REDO
